# Release signing — the app's permanent Play Store identity. Never commit
# this: losing it is unrecoverable (can never update the app again under
# this listing), and leaking it lets anyone sign a build as this app.
# debug.keystore above this line is NOT secret (a well-known, shared key
# Android generates for every project) and stays tracked on purpose.
app/release.keystore
keystore.properties
